CamStudio Pro\par
Publisher: Zeeshan Tanveer\par\par
This installer installs CamStudio Pro and its Windows virtual camera component. Administrator permission is required.\par
Phone video and audio are processed locally. Streaming to an external service occurs when you configure and start a broadcast.\par\par
Third-party license notices are installed with the application. You may uninstall CamStudio Pro using Windows Settings. Recordings and user settings are retained.\par
